      equipment: 'Standard pack, poker chips, one six-sided die (D6).',
      dealing: 'The dealer rolls the D6 to establish the hand rules. Players are dealt 4, 5, or 6 hole cards face down. Five community cards are dealt in the flop (3), turn (1), and river (1) pattern.',
    },
    turnFlow: '1. **Format Roll**: Dealer rolls die: 1-2 = 4-card, 3-4 = 5-card, 5-6 = 6-card. High/Low is determined by house rule or second roll. 2. **Betting**: Standard Pot Limit structure. 3. **Hand Construction**: You MUST use exactly two cards from your hand and exactly three cards from the community board to form a five-card hand.',
    moveValidityConditions: {
      ante: 'Binglao Poker typically uses small and big blinds rather than a forced ante before each deal.',
      deal: 'The randomized distribution of hole cards and community cards is managed by the system automated dealer.',
      reveal_market: 'Omaha uses a board of community cards which are revealed in stages rather than a shared market area.',
      buy_market: 'Players cannot purchase community cards; they are dealt by the system to all active players simultaneously.',
      buy_stock: 'New cards are only received through the system dealing phases and cannot be purchased from the stock.',
      fold: 'Allowed during any betting interval.',
      check: 'Only available when no player has made a bet in the current interval.',
      call: 'Allowed only during betting intervals when a bet has been placed.',
      bet: "Allowed when it is the player's turn and no bet is active.",
      raise: "Allowed when a bet has been placed and it is the player's turn.",
      declare: 'Hand strength is established during the showdown comparison rather than through a formal declaration.',
      reveal_hand: 'Hole cards remain private until the final showdown logic is triggered by the system automated logic.',
      award_pot: 'System only.',
      play_card: 'Binglao Poker is a hand-ranking shared-card game where cards are held rather than played to tricks.',
      draw: 'There is no draw phase in Omaha variants; all hole cards are received during the initial deal.',
      discard: 'Players must keep all hole cards dealt to them and select exactly two at showdown.',
      pass: 'Players must either check, bet, or fold during their turn; a simple pass without action is not supported.',
      bid: 'Binglao uses standard poker wagering structures rather than an auction-style bidding system.',
      meld: 'Hand resolution is based strictly on five-card poker hierarchies rather than forming melds.',
      go_out: 'The round concludes automatically after the final showdown and pot distribution are completed.',
